; Man-of-War — ported verbatim from FATHOM.EXE main:models3d.js (the `manofwar`
; entry). 35 vertices. Giant three-masted flagship with high stern castles,
; dual-deck gunport accent lines, and a triangular mizzen lateen sail.
;
; AXIS CONVERSION: JS (+Z forward, left-handed) → Godot (-Z forward,
; right-handed). Every JS vertex (x, y, z) becomes (x, y, -z). JS `mastZ`
; in sailDeformations is likewise negated.

